[b]Wolfe Wave Scanner Pro[/b]

[b]What it does[/b]
Searches a depth window of confirmed swings for every distinct, non-overlapping 5-point Wolfe Wave wedge — a contracting, alternating channel where point 5 tests the 1-3 trendline — not just the single highest-scoring one. Each candidate is scored 0-100 across nine continuous structural criteria; every valid pattern draws its own wedge and a live-updating EPA (Estimated Price at Arrival) target, tracked independently through its own lifecycle until it hits target, invalidates, or expires.

Wolfe Waves are strongly interpretation-dependent — treat this as a structural setup finder with a quality score, not a signal machine: a found pattern means "a Wolfe-shaped geometry exists here, worth checking against context," not "enter now."

[b]Scoring[/b]
[list]
[*]Wedge structure (point 3 undercuts/exceeds point 1, point 5 extends beyond point 3)
[*]Channel contraction (real narrowing ratio + monotonic through the midpoint) and boundary slope consistency
[*]Channel/traversal quality: point 4's distance off the 1-3 line and completion of the point-4-to-point-5 leg
[*]Apex convergence of lines 1-3 and 2-4 ahead of point 5
[*]Directional point-5 test against the 1-3 line, with separate inside/overshoot tolerances
[*]Risk/reward of the EPA target vs. point 5, relative to the invalidation level
[*]Timing and leg-time symmetry of the five legs
[*]Leg purity — rejects a point selection that skips a countermove nearly as large as the leg itself
[/list]

[b]Features[/b]
[list]
[*]Best-of-window swing search across non-consecutive combinations, not just the last 5 swings
[*]Tracks multiple simultaneously valid, non-overlapping patterns at once — a second genuine Wolfe wave elsewhere on the chart isn't discarded just because it scores lower
[*]Live EPA target line, recomputed from line 1-4 every bar, not frozen at the apex projection
[*]Full pattern lifecycle per tracked pattern (Active, Partial Success, Target Hit, Expired, Invalidated), each with its own alert
[*]Near-miss candidate marker and score-breakdown debug table for threshold tuning
[*]Dashboard with status, active pattern count, best score, bias, live EPA, EPA at ETA, and invalidation level
[*]Bull/bear alerts with bar-close confirmation
[/list]

